    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-14 11:05:29 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Reports rats outside near the kitchen and says they have entered the kitchen, including beneath the sink, after the household returned from four days away. Says the landlord previously arranged baiting, which reduced activity for a time. The pest controller reportedly mentioned openings outside near the drains and said a report would follow. Tenant asks for prompt attention and says they are not comfortable living with rats indoors. A small dog lives at the property; the tenant reports no access restrictions.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 631
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-14 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-14 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-14 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-14 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Acknowledges the report and says the landlord will be contacted about approval before works are arranged. Invites the tenant to provide any further relevant details.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 281
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 12:36:24 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 12:36:24 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 12:36:24 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 12:36:24 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Requests confirmation on how to proceed with the reported rat activity and possible openings by the kitchen drain. Relays the tenant's account of previous baiting and the pest controller's reported offer to provide a written report. Asks whether the landlord approves Northbridge Lettings arranging works or would prefer to use his own contractor.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 465
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 15:25:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 15:25:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 15:25:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 56,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-17 15:25:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asks for an urgent call back and provides 07700 900184. Does not give written approval or specify whether he will arrange the work himself.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 257
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:05:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:05:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:05:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:05:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Leaves a voicemail asking the landlord to call back about the tenant's report and confirm whether he wants to use his own pest contractor or have Northbridge Lettings arrange an inspection.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 306
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:49:07 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:49:07 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:49:07 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 10:49:07 UTC",
      "sender": "Gareth Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Discusses an earlier property record that he recalls from December 2024: traps had been placed inside and outside, a kitchen kickboard was replaced during investigation, and the record reportedly said filling the external openings might not be feasible. He is unsure why. He also recalls a separate pest contractor having been used previously. No current written pest report, diagnosis, cost, or confirmed entry route is provided during the call.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 563
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-18 11:26:02 UTC",
