      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 11:25:50 UTC",
      "sender": "Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "Automated escalation generated because no confirmation of completion has been recorded for the landlord-arranged pest treatment or proofing. The latest tenant update says visits were ongoing and openings remained unsealed.",
