      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 14:14:47 UTC",
      "sender": "Tara Wren (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant says pest control attended that morning and removed its equipment, which they understood to be the final visit. They believe separate contractors are due the next day to open or work on the wall area. This differs from the earlier description of openings beneath the sink; the call does not establish the intended scope or that any opening has been sealed.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 478
    },
    {
